WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,840 --> 00:00:11,240
Why hasn't that ghost come yet?

2
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,820
Are you kidding me? Team leader

3
00:00:13,820 --> 00:00:16,060
Could it be that the information is wrong?

4
00:00:16,340 --> 00:00:18,020
If you get the signal yourself

5
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:19,060
There can still be a lie

6
00:00:19,060 --> 00:01:06,740
This guy shouldn't have time to call it a day

7
00:01:07,060 --> 00:01:11,140
Enough of the show

8
00:01:11,580 --> 00:01:12,500
Order confirmation

9
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:14,300
The electromagnetic lift bubble has been recycled

10
00:01:14,300 --> 00:01:26,150
Please evacuate. We can help you.
